Installation Dependencies for Ubuntu with Shodan only:

Install Git
sudo apt install git

Install Python3
sudo apt install python3

Install the Python virtual environment package
sudo apt install python3.10-venv -y

Install Pip
sudo apt install python3-pip -y

Get an API Key from Shodan:
https://developer.shodan.io/api/requirements

Get AI Cyber Watchdog from Github:
git clone https://github.com/TheShadoru/AI-Cyber-Watchdog.git

Set directory to path of watchdog installation
cd AI-Cyber-Watchdog

Setup the Python Virtual Environment
python3 -m venv venv

Install Python dependencies
./venv/bin/python3 -m pip install -r requirements.txt

Create a “reports” directory to store module logs
mkdir reports

Start AI Cyber Watchdog
./venv/bin/python3 main.py

#end
